WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.808
Vinnie was so scared he couldn’t move.

2
00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:11.352
Suddenly he felt a strong wind by his ear.

3
00:00:11.353 --> 00:00:14.202
An arrow flew by.

4
00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:20.098
One of the hyenas let out a cry, and the animals ran away.

5
00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:24.282
"Vinnie!" Mandy ran to her brother.

6
00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:28.834
"I’m okay," said Vinnie. "But who . . . ?"

7
00:00:28.835 --> 00:00:33.722
He stopped and stared at a young man holding a bow and arrow.

8
00:00:33.723 --> 00:00:38.154
He also wore an animal skin tied at his waist.

9
00:00:38.155 --> 00:00:42.665
He had six scars on his chest on his right side.

10
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:46.250
The man stared at the children for a long time.

11
00:00:46.251 --> 00:00:50.094
Then he said, "Where do you come from?"

12
00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:54.745
"Our home is far away," replied Mandy.

13
00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:57.803
"We’re on a journey."

14
00:00:57.804 --> 00:01:00.847
The man stared a bit longer.

15
00:01:00.848 --> 00:01:03.079
He seemed curious.

16
00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.030
"How long will your journey be?" he asked.

17
00:01:07.031 --> 00:01:10.472
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

18
00:01:10.473 --> 00:01:14.810
"We don’t know," they answered.

19
00:01:14.811 --> 00:01:17.633
The man motioned to them.

20
00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:21.350
"Let us go to the village," he said.

21
00:01:21.351 --> 00:01:23.083
"You will be safe there."

22
00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:24.803
He walked away.

23
00:01:24.804 --> 00:01:27.741
Mandy looked at her brother.

24
00:01:27.742 --> 00:01:32.217
"What do we do?" she said.

25
00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:35.828
"Let’s follow him," replied Vinnie.

26
00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.085
"I don’t think he’ll hurt us.

27
00:01:38.086 --> 00:01:42.643
After all, he saved me from those scary wolves."

28
00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:46.615
"They were hyenas," said Mandy.

29
00:01:46.616 --> 00:01:50.066
The children ran after the man.

30
00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:54.215
"Excuse me," said Vinnie, "where are we?"

31
00:01:54.216 --> 00:02:00.462
"This is the Kalahari Desert, home of my people," he replied.

32
00:02:00.463 --> 00:02:04.754
"Who are your people?" asked Mandy.

33
00:02:04.755 --> 00:02:08.014
"We are the Ju/’hoansi," he said.

34
00:02:08.015 --> 00:02:11.407
"I am Kashe. What are your names?"

35
00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:15.137
The children introduced themselves.

36
00:02:15.138 --> 00:02:18.893
Kashe stopped in front of an open area.

37
00:02:18.894 --> 00:02:21.023
"Welcome to our village,"

38
00:02:21.024 --> 00:02:24.612
he said, pointing to ten small huts.

39
00:02:24.613 --> 00:02:28.347
The huts were made out of sticks and grass.

40
00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:33.051
"Kashe!" a woman called out.

41
00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:37.416
"You went hunting for food, but you bring us children."

42
00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:41.345
The villagers all stopped what they were doing.

43
00:02:41.346 --> 00:02:44.104
They surrounded the children.

44
00:02:44.105 --> 00:02:47.438
The men were dressed like Kashe.

45
00:02:47.439 --> 00:02:51.122
The women also wore animal skins.

46
00:02:51.123 --> 00:02:54.907
Most of them had jewelry around their necks.

47
00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:59.142
Some wore brightly colored bands around their heads.

48
00:02:59.143 --> 00:03:02.934
Kashe introduced the children to everyone.

49
00:03:02.935 --> 00:03:06.214
Then the crowd wandered away.

50
00:03:06.215 --> 00:03:09.804
But one curious young girl remained.

51
00:03:09.805 --> 00:03:13.286
"Twi!" a woman called to the girl.

52
00:03:13.287 --> 00:03:16.270
"We have work to do."

53
00:03:16.271 --> 00:03:19.686
"Yes, Mama," Twi called back.

54
00:03:19.687 --> 00:03:22.287
Then she turned to Mandy.

55
00:03:22.288 --> 00:03:25.878
"Will you come with us?" she asked.

56
00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:29.535
"Where?" said Mandy.

57
00:03:29.536 --> 00:03:34.018
"To gather mongongo nuts," said Twi.

58
00:03:34.019 --> 00:03:37.337
She looked up at the bright sun.

59
00:03:37.338 --> 00:03:40.213
"We should have left a while ago.

60
00:03:40.214 --> 00:03:42.874
I can tell it will be hot today."

61
00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:46.937
"But it’s hot already!" cried Mandy.

62
00:03:46.938 --> 00:03:50.866
Twi laughed. "This is not hot.

63
00:03:50.867 --> 00:03:54.088
It is still early in the day."

64
00:03:54.089 --> 00:03:57.278
Mandy wiped her forehead.

65
00:03:57.279 --> 00:04:01.641
"It’s going to get hotter?" she thought.

66
00:04:01.642 --> 00:04:05.472
"Come with me, Vinnie," Kashe said.

67
00:04:05.473 --> 00:04:08.738
"Where are we going?" asked Vinnie.

68
00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:11.998
Kashe gave Vinnie a bow.

69
00:04:11.999 --> 00:04:15.342
"We must return to the hunt," he replied.

70
00:04:15.343 --> 00:04:23.100
"Cool!" yelled Vinnie.

